│ +# Windows Manager
│ +
│ +A comprehensive Windows management tool with enhanced features for system monitoring and control.
│ +
│ +## Features
│ +
│ +- **System Information**: Get detailed system information including OS details, hardware specs, etc.
│ +- **Network Diagnostics**: Basic network speed tests and adapter information
│ +- **Registry Management**: Read system registry values
│ +- **Audio Control**: Adjust system volume levels
│ +- **Display Brightness**: Control screen brightness settings
│ +
│ +## Installation
│ +
│ +1. Clone the repository
│ +2. Install dependencies:
│ +   ```
│ +   pip install -r requirements.txt
│ +   ```
│ +
│ +## Usage
│ +
│ +```python
│ +from windows_manager import WindowsManager
│ +
│ +# Create instance
│ +manager = WindowsManager()
│ +
│ +# Get system information
│ +system_info = manager.get_system_info()
│ +
│ +# Test network speed
│ +network_info = manager.network_speed_test()
│ +
│ +# Read registry values
│ +registry_data = manager.get_registry_values("HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Class\\{4d36e968-e325-11ce-bfc1-08002be10318}")
│ +
│ +# Adjust audio volume (0-100)
│ +manager.adjust_audio_volume(75)
│ +
│ +# Set display brightness (0-100)  
│ +manager.set_display_brightness(80)
│ +
│ +# Run all tests
│ +results = manager.run_all_tests()
│ +```
│ +
│ +## Testing
│ +
│ +To run all tests:
│ +```bash
│ +python windows_manager.py
│ +```
│ +
│ +## Requirements
│ +
│ +- Windows 10/11
│ +- Python 3.8 or higher
│ +- Admin privileges for some operations
